# --- Claude Code / agent tooling --------------------------------------------
# Committed on purpose (shared with the team): AGENTS.md and its provider
# pointers, .claude/settings.json, .claude/skills/, .mcp.json, skills-lock.json
.claude/settings.local.json

# Regenerable duplicate of .claude/skills/ for non-Claude agents. Keep it
# ignored: when .agents/ is absent, `npx skills update` maintains
# .claude/skills/ in place; when it is present, it replaces those files with
# symlinks, which Windows checkouts cannot follow.
.agents/

